@* المستندات: كل ما أنشأه الجهاز وحالته على السيرفر (بانتظار الرفع/حُفظ/بانتظار المراجعة/خطأ/مرفوض). *@
@page "/outbox"
@implements IDisposable
@inject AppState State
@inject ISnackbar Snackbar

<div class="ra-page">
    <div class="ra-row">
        <h1 class="mud-typography mud-typography-h5 ra-grow">المستندات</h1>
        <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" Color="Color.Primary" Class="ra-btn" Disabled="@_syncing" OnClick="SyncAsync" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Sync">مزامنة</MudButton>
    </div>
    @if (_items.Count == 0)
    {
        <MudText Class="ra-muted ra-gap">لا مستندات بعد.</MudText>
    }
    else
    {
        <MudList T="string" Class="ra-gap">
            @foreach (var o in _items)
            {
                <MudListItem T="string">
                    <div class="ra-row">
                        <MudIcon Icon="@TypeIcon(o.Doc_Type)" Color="Color.Primary" />
                        <div class="ra-grow">
                            <div><b>@TypeName(o.Doc_Type)</b>@if (o.Doc_No != null) { <span class="ra-muted"> <bdi>@o.Doc_No</bdi></span> } — @(_names.TryGetValue(o.Customer_Id, out var n) ? n : "")</div>
                            <div class="ra-muted">@o.Created_At.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm")@(o.Result_Ref_Id != null ? $" · رقم {o.Result_Ref_Id}" : "")</div>
                            @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(o.Error) && o.Status != OutboxStatus.Processed) { <div class="ra-muted" style="color:var(--mud-palette-error)">@o.Error</div> }
                        </div>
                        <div style="text-align:end">
                            <div class="ra-num"><b>@o.Amount.ToString("N2")</b></div>
                            <MudChip T="string" Size="Size.Small" Color="@StatusColor(o.Status)">@StatusName(o.Status)</MudChip>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </MudListItem>
            }
        </MudList>
    }
</div>

@code {
    private List<OutboxItem> _items = new();
    private Dictionary<long, string> _names = new();
    private bool _syncing;

    protected override void OnInitialized()
    {
        State.Changed += Refresh;
        Load();
    }

    private void Load()
    {
        _items = State.Store.Outbox().OrderByDescending(o => o.Created_At).Take(300).ToList();
        _names = State.Book.Customers.ToDictionary(c => c.Id, c => c.Name);
    }

    private void Refresh() => InvokeAsync(() => { Load(); StateHasChanged(); });

    private async Task SyncAsync()
    {
        _syncing = true;
        try
        {
            var r = await State.SyncNowAsync();
            if (r.Offline) Snackbar.Add("لا اتصال؛ تُرفع لاحقاً.", Severity.Warning);
            else if (r.Error != null) Snackbar.Add(r.Error, Severity.Error);
        }
        finally { _syncing = false; Load(); }
    }

    private static string TypeName(DocType t) => t switch { DocType.Sale => "بيع", DocType.Collection => "تحصيل", DocType.Return => "مرتجع", DocType.TakeOrder => "طلبية", DocType.Delivery => "تسليم", DocType.Cheque => "شيك", DocType.NoSale => "بلا بيع", DocType.CheckIn => "دخول", DocType.CheckOut => "خروج", _ => "مستند" };

    private static string TypeIcon(DocType t) => t switch
    {
        DocType.Sale => Icons.Material.Filled.PointOfSale, DocType.Collection => Icons.Material.Filled.Payments, DocType.Return => Icons.Material.Filled.AssignmentReturn,
        DocType.TakeOrder => Icons.Material.Filled.NoteAdd, DocType.Delivery => Icons.Material.Filled.LocalShipping, DocType.Cheque => Icons.Material.Filled.RequestPage, DocType.CheckIn => Icons.Material.Filled.Storefront, DocType.CheckOut => Icons.Material.Filled.Logout,
        _ => Icons.Material.Filled.DoNotDisturbOn,
    };

    private static string StatusName(OutboxStatus s) => s switch
    {
        OutboxStatus.Queued => "بانتظار الرفع",
        OutboxStatus.Received => "وصل",
        OutboxStatus.Processed => "حُفظ",
        OutboxStatus.PendingReview => "بانتظار المراجعة",
        OutboxStatus.Error => "خطأ",
        OutboxStatus.Rejected => "مرفوض",
        _ => "",
    };

    private static Color StatusColor(OutboxStatus s) => s switch
    {
        OutboxStatus.Processed => Color.Success,
        OutboxStatus.PendingReview or OutboxStatus.Queued => Color.Warning,
        OutboxStatus.Error => Color.Error,
        _ => Color.Default,
    };

    public void Dispose() => State.Changed -= Refresh;
}
